message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Analysis code for: An observationally constrained probabilistic trigger for organized deep convection in an NWP ensemble"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Muetzelfeldt
    given-names: Mark R.
    email: mark.muetzelfeldt@reading.ac.uk
    affiliation: "Department of Meteorology, University of Reading"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6851-7351"
repository-code: "https://github.com/markmuetz/mcs_prime_stoch_trigger"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mesoscale convective systems
  - stochastic parametrization
  - ensemble forecasting
  - Unified Model
  - MCSP
abstract: >-
  Analysis code (remake workflows) used to produce the figures in Muetzelfeldt et al.,
  "An observationally constrained probabilistic trigger for organized deep convection
  in an NWP ensemble" (submitted to QJRMS). It processes N216 Unified Model ensemble
  simulations and GPM IMERG V07 precipitation on JASMIN.
